<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">04052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>One hundred aircraft and fifteen thousand US troops have moved to the Strait of Hormuz, as Washington launches what it calls Project Freedom to escort neutral tankers through Iran's territorial waters.</s> <s>Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent says Iran will begin mothballing oil wells within days as blockaded storage fills... a process that permanently degrades reservoirs and can't be reversed when a deal is struck.</s> <s>Tehran has rejected Washington's latest terms, and a senior US official concedes the mission is really about coordinating insurers and flag states, not warships.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's Bharatiya Janata Party is leading early counts in two of West Bengal's first declared seats, threatening Mamata Banerjee's Trinamool Congress hold since twenty eleven.</s> <s>A win would mark the BJP's first capture of a non-Hindi-belt eastern state, a structural breakthrough Modi has chased for a decade.</s> <s>Tamil Nadu's posting the cycle's tightest race, while Assam exit polls project the ruling alliance returning.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Papua New Guinea's National Court is using human-rights provisions to enjoin clan violence in Hela province before it starts.</s> <s>Judges are acting as preemptive peacebuilders inside live tribal-conflict zones, treating injunctions as justiciable under existing constitutional law without new legislation.</s> <s>The Supreme Court must now uphold the jurisdiction for the experiment to outlast its founding bench.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two US service members vanished Saturday near a cliff in Morocco's Cap Draa training area during African Lion, the largest annual American exercise on the continent.</s> <s>US Africa Command and Moroccan forces have launched ground, air and maritime searches, but the command hasn't disclosed which branch they served.</s> <s>The disappearance lands at a moment when Washington's military footprint across the Maghreb is already under quiet scrutiny.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Trump called Pope Leo the Fourteenth terrible and threatened to pull American troops from Italy after Rome refused to host Sicily as a weapons staging base for the Iran war.</s> <s>Secretary of State Marco Rubio visits the Vatican on the seventh and eighth of May, meeting Cardinal Pietro Parolin to repair the breach.</s> <s>It's the sharpest public rupture between a sitting American president and the Holy See in living memory.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israel bombed the Zawtar villages north of the Litani Thursday, pushing past the April ceasefire line after Hezbollah drones struck Israeli positions on the southern bank.</s> <s>Israeli forces remain dug in at Taybeh inside Lebanon, and a retired general says the advance is stalled by drone harassment rather than political restraint.</s> <s>The ceasefire architecture is now breached on both sides, with no mediator volunteering to rebuild it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukraine struck Russia's one-million-barrel Baltic terminal at Primorsk, opening a second maritime front against Moscow's oil exports.</s> <s>Russia's Black Sea and Baltic corridors are now both within Ukrainian fire, a geographic widening that earlier in the war seemed beyond Kyiv's reach.</s> <s>The Leningrad governor says no spill occurred, but a Karakurt missile carrier docked nearby took damage.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's central bank raised its policy rate one hundred basis points to eleven and a half percent, citing April inflation at ten point nine percent... the first double-digit reading in twenty-one months.</s> <s>Petrol prices have surged fifty percent in two months, and debt servicing already consumes forty-six point seven percent of federal expenditure.</s> <s>It's a textbook choice of stabilisation over growth, made into a slowdown the Iran-war oil shock is deepening.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The United Arab Emirates quit OPEC on the first of May, hours before seven remaining members voted a one hundred eighty-eight thousand barrel-per-day June output hike.</s> <s>It's the third monthly increase unwinding the twenty twenty-three cuts, but the more consequential story is that one of the cartel's wealthiest members chose defection over discipline.</s> <s>The bloc meets again on the seventh of June and can pause the phaseout if markets deteriorate.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Vietnam, Indonesia and Malaysia have spent years routing Chinese inputs through local assembly to qualify for American market access.</s> <s>Washington's new rules-of-origin require local-content thresholds most regional factories simply cannot meet, and goods failing certification lose preferential entry.</s> <s>It's a single regulatory lever capable of unwinding a decade of supply-chain integration without a new tariff being announced.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Asian Development Bank pledged seventy billion dollars to connect Asia-Pacific power grids and digital networks by twenty thirty-five.</s> <s>Pakistan holds surplus generating capacity it cannot export because regional grids remain fragmented and bilateral trust between regulators is brittle.</s> <s>The bank targets twenty gigawatts of cross-border trade, a financing layer rather than wires-on-the-ground.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Abuja, Nigerian commuters are parking their cars and crowding onto buses as fuel prices outrun middle-class wages.</s> <s>President Tinubu removed petrol subsidies in twenty twenty-three, and naira depreciation has compounded pump-price inflation past what salaried earners can absorb.</s> <s>Oil revenues are rising with global prices, but the gains are not reaching the households the subsidy used to shield.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers in London have built a dual-signal patch that drives blood-vessel growth in damaged tracheal tissue, something neither signal achieves alone.</s> <s>Ultrasound triggers simultaneous mechanical expansion and piezoelectric microcurrents, and only the cascade of both wakes the regenerative response.</s> <s>Synthetic grafts have failed these defects for decades because anastomotic sites lacked exactly this vascular ingrowth.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Every Lassa fever vaccine candidate must now clear full efficacy trials, after researchers confirmed no immune marker reliably predicts survival.</s> <s>The disease is endemic across Nigeria, Sierra Leone, Liberia and Guinea, killing thousands annually with no licensed vaccine after decades of work.</s> <s>Without a measurable correlate of protection, the development pipeline can't be shortened, and the African endemic zone keeps paying the cost.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A study of Iraq's major cities finds only six percent of Basrah's summer hours are thermally comfortable without active cooling.</s> <s>Evaporative coolers, which chill air through water evaporation, added fifty-four percent more comfortable hours in Basrah, forty-one percent in Baghdad, thirty-one percent in Mosul.</s> <s>The technology uses a fraction of the electricity of conventional air conditioning, in sha'Allah a usable answer where grids buckle every July.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Chemists in Washington have built a polymer that fully degrades in six days, with no microplastic residue.</s> <s>Two bacterial strains embedded in the material activate on command and consume it from within, turning the plastic into its own undertaker.</s> <s>Microplastics are now measurable in human placentas and blood, and at-source degradation cuts off a contamination route the cleanup industry has no answer for.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>J. Craig Venter, who in twenty ten created the first cell driven by a fully synthetic genome, has died in San Diego.</s> <s>His work proved life could run on designed DNA, yet fifteen years on, no organism engineered from scratch has reached commercial use.</s> <s>Researchers say the remaining gap isn't synthesis... it's the design rules for genomes we still don't understand.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>California will start ticketing driverless cars directly from the first of July, closing a loophole that's left Waymo and Cruise effectively untouchable for moving violations.</s> <s>American traffic law required a human recipient for citations, and operators must now respond to police calls within thirty seconds.</s> <s>It's the first state to make autonomous vehicles liable as legal entities, a precedent every other jurisdiction will borrow from.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mercedes is restoring physical buttons to its thirty-nine-inch touchscreen cabins after a decade of glass-only design.</s> <s>Germany's GLC and C-Class will pair the Mercedes-Benz User Experience display with steering-wheel and dashboard controls, driven by Euro NCAP's twenty twenty-six safety protocol downgrading cars that bury core functions in menus.</s> <s>A safety rating, not customer taste, has reversed the industry's flagship interface trend.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bengaluru-based GalaxEye has launched the world's first satellite combining optical and synthetic-aperture radar sensors on one platform.</s> <s>Radar pierces cloud and night, and pairing it with an optical sensor on the same bus eliminates the matching errors of two separate satellites.</s> <s>India's targeting a ten-satellite constellation, a quiet entry into a market dominated by American and European earth-observation firms.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Pretoria, twelve thousand teachers have enrolled in a WhatsApp-based hearing screener for schoolchildren in just one month.</s> <s>Only ten percent of South Africa's mandated school hearing screenings happen annually, blocked by equipment and staffing gaps a chat-bot can sidestep.</s> <s>The University of Pretoria team is now seeking accreditation to scale the tool nationally.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>